=== EE items that have English Wikipedia articles ===
{{SPARQL2|query=SELECT ?name (URI(CONCAT("https://doi.org/10.13051/ee:bio/", ?ee)) AS ?eelink) ?englishwp
WHERE {
?person wdt:P3429 ?ee;
